{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-07-26 16:05:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ ANNOUNCES MID-MONTH OPEN SHORT INTEREST POSITIONS IN NASDAQ STOCKS AS OF SETTLEMENT DATE JULY 15, 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JULY 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AT THE END OF THE SETTLEMENT DATE OF\xa0JULY 15, 2021, SHORT INTEREST IN 2,732 NASDAQ GLOBAL MARKETSM\xa0SECURITIES TOTALLED 8,537,253,537 SHARES COMPARED WITH 8,643,173,593 SHARES IN 2,706 GLOBAL MARKET ISSUES REPORTED FOR THE PRIOR SETTLEMENT DATE OF\xa0JUNE 30, 2021. THE MID-MONTH JULY SHORT INTEREST REPRESENTS 2.95 DAYS COMPARED WITH 2.85 DAYS FOR THE PRIOR REPORTING PERIOD.'}